# Scope guard

- Build only what AGENTS.md and specs/ approve. If a ticket seems to need more, stop and say so in the pull request instead of building it.
- Lyric timing is one optional `startSeconds` per line, set by the audio scan or by stamping a line. Never add end times, word/mora timing, tempo or beats-per-line pacing, sync offsets, or timing tables/columns.
- Only three screens (Song Library, Import Song in development only, Learn Song) and only the API routes in AGENTS.md and docs/codebase.md.
- No accounts, analytics, runtime provider/catalog APIs, autoplay, looping, or microphone. The only learner writes are saving line start times and scanning a saved song.
- Never edit AGENTS.md or anything under specs/. Those are Victor's plan documents.
- Never add inactive fields or UI "for later".
- If you add a folder, route, setting, or data field, update docs/codebase.md in the same change.
